### =====================================================
### Login 2FA Verify - POST /account/login/2fa/verify
### NOTA: {{token}} debe ser el mfaToken devuelto por
### /account/login cuando requiresTwoFactor = true
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Verificar código 2FA por email (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456",
  "method": "Email"
}

### Test 2: Verificar código 2FA con app authenticator — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "654321",
  "method": "Authenticator"
}

### Test 3: Método 2FA inválido — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456",
  "method": "sms"
}

### Test 4: Código incorrecto o expirado — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "000000",
  "method": "Email"
}

### Test 5: Sin token (mfaToken) — 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456",
  "method": "Email"
}

### Test 6: Campo requerido faltante (sin code) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login/2fa/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "Email"
}
